  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TZ: Many Hands Make Light Work: Eliminate slavery in child domestic work</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Impact: Children involved in child domestic work are free from abuse and exploitation and have their rights respected, enabling them to lead full and independent lives.

Main activities include: Income-generating activities (IGA) for vulnerable families, awareness raising for guardians, training of employers, psychosocial and legal support to abused Child Domestic Workers (CDWs), establishment and meetings of Child Protection Committees, work with teachers, training for duty-bearers etc.</narrative>
  </description>
